        {
          "text": "**Custom GPTs & Agents:** Moving beyond *prompting* in a chat to *building* a persistent, specialized AI agent within the ChatGPT ecosystem. This aligns with your interest in \"Agentic Use\".",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 108,
          "source": "topic-set-advanced-prompt-engineering-and-llm-mastery-🆔20251021195149.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Tokenization & Context Windows:** A more technical dive into *why* models behave the way they do, exploring how text is \"seen\" by the AI and the hard limitations of its \"memory\".",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 113,
          "source": "topic-set-advanced-prompt-engineering-and-llm-mastery-🆔20251021195149.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Model \"Temperature\" & Creative Control:** Understanding the (often hidden) parameters that govern AI creativity versus factual precision and how to influence them through instructional cues.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 120,
          "source": "topic-set-advanced-prompt-engineering-and-llm-mastery-🆔20251021195149.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Comparative Model Architectures:** A high-level look at what *structurally* differentiates models like Google's Gemini family from OpenAI's GPT series, and how those architectural choices manifest as user-facing behaviors.",
          "indent_level": 1,
